    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d446">

                <pb facs="0682" n="570" sameAs="frus:frus1907p1/pg570"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 1229/1.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the British
                    Ambassador</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-10-15"><hi rendition="#italic">October 15,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 545.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the
                    receipt of your note of the 10th instant, expressing the thanks of His Majesty’s
                    Government <pb facs="0683" n="571" xml:id="pg571"/> for this Government’s action
                    in conditionally waiving its extraterritorial rights in Zanzibar, and to say
                    that this department would be pleased to be advised when the German Government
                    shall have made a similar waiver.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Elihu Root.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
